WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.935
[A phone buzzes in the open suitcase.]
MOM: outside!

00:00.210 --> 00:01.485
Mom's outside.

00:01.775 --> 00:03.045
Thanksgiving break starts now…

00:03.380 --> 00:04.485
did I turn everything in?

00:04.715 --> 00:06.665
Even my Blackboard's ready for the holiday…

00:06.915 --> 00:07.725
with Glaze.

00:07.060 --> 00:07.975
[A drop of Glaze splashes onto the laptop.]

00:08.115 --> 00:08.925
Harvest moon…

00:08.115 --> 00:09.395
Harvest Moon

00:09.395 --> 00:09.985
turkeys…

00:09.395 --> 00:10.755
Turkey Trot

00:10.235 --> 00:11.585
or a cozy fire?

00:10.755 --> 00:11.835
Hearthside

00:11.975 --> 00:14.005
Okay, that lab report…

00:13.855 --> 00:14.245
Submitted.

00:13.855 --> 00:14.775
Submitted

00:14.775 --> 00:15.700
The quiz…

00:15.730 --> 00:16.450
graded.

00:15.730 --> 00:16.600
Graded

00:16.535 --> 00:17.540
One essay left.

00:17.835 --> 00:18.725
It's on my list…

00:18.955 --> 00:19.785
due after break.

00:20.075 --> 00:20.745
And the final?

00:21.155 --> 00:22.285
What if I get an 85…

00:22.915 --> 00:23.725
still an A.

00:22.915 --> 00:23.975
What-if: 90.2%

00:24.035 --> 00:24.685
Nothing missing.

00:25.115 --> 00:26.265
Nothing hanging over dinner.

00:26.540 --> 00:28.050
[She runs out the door with her suitcase and a pie.]

00:26.740 --> 00:27.825
I'm thankful for that.

00:28.150 --> 00:28.845
Glaze.

00:28.400 --> 00:31.667
New in Glaze 4.0.8: three Thanksgiving Looks for Blackboard Ultra, Canvas and Moodle · Free
frostdev.io/glaze · Chrome · Safari · Firefox

00:29.060 --> 00:29.365
Free.

00:29.755 --> 00:30.485
Happy Thanksgiving.
